{"logId": "afb9f4c0-8b35-422f-8130-70cbf1af6ab5", "result": {"layoutParsingResults": [{"prunedResult": {"page_count": null, "width": 1190, "height": 1684, "model_settings": {"use_doc_preprocessor": false, "use_layout_detection": true, "use_chart_recognition": false, "use_seal_recognition": false, "use_ocr_for_image_block": false, "format_block_content": false, "merge_layout_blocks": true, "markdown_ignore_labels": ["number", "footnote", "header", "header_image", "footer", "footer_image", "aside_text"], "return_layout_polygon_points": true}, "parsing_res_list": [{"block_label": "header_image", "block_content": "", "block_bbox": [838, 134, 1083, 254], "block_id": 0, "block_order": null, "group_id": 0, "block_polygon_points": [[838.0, 134.0], [1083.0, 134.0], [1083.0, 254.0], [838.0, 254.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "暖冬", "block_bbox": [239, 227, 426, 283], "block_id": 1, "block_order": 1, "group_id": 1, "block_polygon_points": [[239.0, 227.0], [426.0, 227.0], [426.0, 283.0], [239.0, 283.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "作者：超市部保洁/于俊霞", "block_bbox": [235, 292, 426, 315], "block_id": 2, "block_order": 2, "group_id": 2, "block_polygon_points": [[235.0, 292.0], [426.0, 292.0], [426.0, 315.0], [235.0, 315.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "今年灯节，正月十五那天，十一点左右，正是客流高峰期，我看到玉兰油专柜西边坐着两个老人，看上去大娘像是很痛苦的样子，在那儿呻吟，大爷在旁边很焦急的搓着手，无奈地望着大娘。", "block_bbox": [198, 372, 974, 467], "block_id": 3, "block_order": 3, "group_id": 3, "block_polygon_points": [[198.0, 372.0], [974.0, 372.0], [974.0, 467.0], [198.0, 467.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "看到这情景，我不由地停下来问：“大娘作了”。大爷抬头望着我说：“有病，几种病，并发症，看不好了。”老人说这话的时候唉声叹气，很无助的样子。", "block_bbox": [198, 476, 976, 538], "block_id": 4, "block_order": 4, "group_id": 4, "block_polygon_points": [[198.0, 476.0], [976.0, 476.0], [976.0, 538.0], [198.0, 538.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "当时来来往往的顾客特多，坐在那里不方便，我招呼大爷一块把大娘扶到通道坐下，给大娘端上一杯热茶，说：“大娘你想吃啥，咱二楼是超市，啥都有，货可全了，让大爷上去给你买一些。”刚说到这不料二老竞掉起泪来，我忙劝他们，大爷稳了稳情绪说：“妞啊，也不怕你笑话，你大娘这个病啊钱都花光了，也没治好，算了也不治了，就等着去的那一天啦，你大娘也没别的心愿，临走一心想来生活广场看看，以前没来过，也没钱坐车，我用车把她拉来了，刚进来就走不动了。”听到这里我的心里好酸，都不知道说些什么来安慰两位老人，只是陪着掉眼泪。大爷看我这样说：“妞，你去忙吧，俺坐一会儿就走了。”", "block_bbox": [197, 546, 976, 817], "block_id": 5, "block_order": 5, "group_id": 5, "block_polygon_points": [[197.0, 546.0], [976.0, 546.0], [976.0, 817.0], [197.0, 817.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "两位老人好可怜，来生活广场就为看看，满足大娘临走的心愿，不行，我不能让他们就这样回去！天下谁没有父母，说不如做，我一摸口袋，好，还有二十块钱，就递上去说：“大爷，你看太少了，你带大娘到三楼吃顿饭再走吧。”二老睁大眼睛看着我，接过钱说：“谢谢妞，谢谢妞，我可没想到这人会这么好。”我忙又拉住二老说：“您们不用", "block_bbox": [198, 827, 976, 959], "block_id": 6, "block_order": 6, "group_id": 6, "block_polygon_points": [[198.0, 827.0], [976.0, 827.0], [976.0, 959.0], [198.0, 959.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "谢，来到这就和到了家一样，要是喜欢下次再来”，两位老人笑了，我也笑了。这时", "block_bbox": [232, 965, 975, 991], "block_id": 7, "block_order": 7, "group_id": 7, "block_polygon_points": [[232.0, 965.0], [975.0, 965.0], [975.0, 991.0], [232.0, 991.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "同事李爱香走过来小声问“那是你亲戚”，我笑没答，“是你认识”，我又笑。", "block_bbox": [278, 999, 968, 1025], "block_id": 8, "block_order": 8, "group_id": 8, "block_polygon_points": [[278.0, 999.0], [968.0, 999.0], [968.0, 1025.0], [278.0, 1025.0]]}, {"block_label": "image", "block_content": "", "block_bbox": [188, 1004, 551, 1246], "block_id": 9, "block_order": null, "group_id": 9, "block_polygon_points": [[188.0, 1004.0], [551.0, 1004.0], [551.0, 1246.0], [188.0, 1246.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "“你给他们钱，我还想着是你认识哩”，“哦，是啊，我们认识。”我们四人都笑了。\n我虽然是名普通的保洁员，但是我也有自己的目标与梦想，我要努力的工作，在改善自己生活水平的基础上，尽自己最大的能力去帮助更多的人。让他们能分享到我们所给予的爱与温暖。", "block_bbox": [478, 1034, 977, 1094], "block_id": 10, "block_order": 9, "group_id": 10, "block_polygon_points": [[478.0, 1034.0], [977.0, 1034.0], [977.0, 1094.0], [478.0, 1094.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "", "block_bbox": [546, 1104, 976, 1236], "block_id": 11, "block_order": 10, "group_id": 10, "block_polygon_points": [[546.0, 1104.0], [976.0, 1104.0], [976.0, 1236.0], [546.0, 1236.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "胖东来印象", "block_bbox": [112, 1407, 295, 1448], "block_id": 12, "block_order": 11, "group_id": 12, "block_polygon_points": [[112.0, 1407.0], [295.0, 1407.0], [295.0, 1448.0], [112.0, 1448.0]]}, {"block_label": "image", "block_content": "", "block_bbox": [1002, 610, 1137, 725], "block_id": 13, "block_order": null, "group_id": 13, "block_polygon_points": [[1002.0, 610.0], [1137.0, 610.0], [1137.0, 725.0], [1002.0, 725.0]]}], "layout_det_res": {"boxes": [{"cls_id": 13, "label": "header_image", "score": 0.7444756031036377, "coordinate": [838, 134, 1083, 254], "order": null, "polygon_points": [[838.0, 134.0], [1083.0, 134.0], [1083.0, 254.0], [838.0, 254.0]]}, {"cls_id": 17, "label": "paragraph_title", "score": 0.4878003001213074, "coordinate": [239, 227, 426, 283], "order": 1, "polygon_points": [[239.0, 227.0], [426.0, 227.0], [426.0, 283.0], [239.0, 283.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.7513549327850342, "coordinate": [235, 292, 426, 315], "order": 2, "polygon_points": [[235.0, 292.0], [426.0, 292.0], [426.0, 315.0], [235.0, 315.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.9324002265930176, "coordinate": [198, 372, 974, 467], "order": 3, "polygon_points": [[198.0, 372.0], [974.0, 372.0], [974.0, 467.0], [198.0, 467.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.9115760326385498, "coordinate": [198, 476, 976, 538], "order": 4, "polygon_points": [[198.0, 476.0], [976.0, 476.0], [976.0, 538.0], [198.0, 538.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.9591468572616577, "coordinate": [197, 546, 976, 817], "order": 5, "polygon_points": [[197.0, 546.0], [976.0, 546.0], [976.0, 817.0], [197.0, 817.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8082733750343323, "coordinate": [198, 827, 976, 959], "order": 6, "polygon_points": [[198.0, 827.0], [976.0, 827.0], [976.0, 959.0], [198.0, 959.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.5939410924911499, "coordinate": [232, 965, 975, 991], "order": 7, "polygon_points": [[232.0, 965.0], [975.0, 965.0], [975.0, 991.0], [232.0, 991.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.5934202671051025, "coordinate": [278, 999, 968, 1025], "order": 8, "polygon_points": [[278.0, 999.0], [968.0, 999.0], [968.0, 1025.0], [278.0, 1025.0]]}, {"cls_id": 14, "label": "image", "score": 0.8100773096084595, "coordinate": [188, 1004, 551, 1246], "order": null, "polygon_points": [[188.0, 1004.0], [551.0, 1004.0], [551.0, 1246.0], [188.0, 1246.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.3354405462741852, "coordinate": [478, 1034, 977, 1094], "order": 9, "polygon_points": [[478.0, 1034.0], [977.0, 1034.0], [977.0, 1094.0], [478.0, 1094.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.9260085821151733, "coordinate": [546, 1104, 976, 1236], "order": 10, "polygon_points": [[546.0, 1104.0], [976.0, 1104.0], [976.0, 1236.0], [546.0, 1236.0]]}, {"cls_id": 17, "label": "paragraph_title", "score": 0.7755599617958069, "coordinate": [112, 1407, 295, 1448], "order": 11, "polygon_points": [[112.0, 1407.0], [295.0, 1407.0], [295.0, 1448.0], [112.0, 1448.0]]}, {"cls_id": 14, "label": "image", "score": 0.5636674165725708, "coordinate": [1002, 610, 1137, 725], "order": null, "polygon_points": [[1002.0, 610.0], [1137.0, 610.0], [1137.0, 725.0], [1002.0, 725.0]]}]}}, "markdown": {"text": "## 暖冬\n\n作者：超市部保洁/于俊霞\n\n今年灯节，正月十五那天，十一点左右，正是客流高峰期，我看到玉兰油专柜西边坐着两个老人，看上去大娘像是很痛苦的样子，在那儿呻吟，大爷在旁边很焦急的搓着手，无奈地望着大娘。\n\n看到这情景，我不由地停下来问：“大娘作了”。大爷抬头望着我说：“有病，几种病，并发症，看不好了。”老人说这话的时候唉声叹气，很无助的样子。\n\n当时来来往往的顾客特多，坐在那里不方便，我招呼大爷一块把大娘扶到通道坐下，给大娘端上一杯热茶，说：“大娘你想吃啥，咱二楼是超市，啥都有，货可全了，让大爷上去给你买一些。”刚说到这不料二老竞掉起泪来，我忙劝他们，大爷稳了稳情绪说：“妞啊，也不怕你笑话，你大娘这个病啊钱都花光了，也没治好，算了也不治了，就等着去的那一天啦，你大娘也没别的心愿，临走一心想来生活广场看看，以前没来过，也没钱坐车，我用车把她拉来了，刚进来就走不动了。”听到这里我的心里好酸，都不知道说些什么来安慰两位老人，只是陪着掉眼泪。大爷看我这样说：“妞，你去忙吧，俺坐一会儿就走了。”\n\n两位老人好可怜，来生活广场就为看看，满足大娘临走的心愿，不行，我不能让他们就这样回去！天下谁没有父母，说不如做，我一摸口袋，好，还有二十块钱，就递上去说：“大爷，你看太少了，你带大娘到三楼吃顿饭再走吧。”二老睁大眼睛看着我，接过钱说：“谢谢妞，谢谢妞，我可没想到这人会这么好。”我忙又拉住二老说：“您们不用\n\n谢，来到这就和到了家一样，要是喜欢下次再来”，两位老人笑了，我也笑了。这时\n\n同事李爱香走过来小声问“那是你亲戚”，我笑没答，“是你认识”，我又笑。\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"imgs/img_in_image_box_188_1004_551_1246.jpg\" alt=\"Image\" width=\"30%\" /></div>\n\n\n“你给他们钱，我还想着是你认识哩”，“哦，是啊，我们认识。”我们四人都笑了。\n\n我虽然是名普通的保洁员，但是我也有自己的目标与梦想，我要努力的工作，在改善自己生活水平的基础上，尽自己最大的能力去帮助更多的人。让他们能分享到我们所给予的爱与温暖。\n\n\n\n## 胖东来印象\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"imgs/img_in_image_box_1002_610_1137_725.jpg\" alt=\"Image\" width=\"11%\" /></div>\n", "images": {"imgs/img_in_header_image_box_838_134_1083_254.jpg": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//afb9f4c0-8b35-422f-8130-70cbf1af6ab5/markdown_0/imgs/img_in_header_image_box_838_134_1083_254.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T07%3A46%3A19Z%2F-1%2F%2F6adf74b2ed32caa657b92a2b65ef298e539471334ddc218db7b480b9814a7164", "imgs/img_in_image_box_188_1004_551_1246.jpg": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//afb9f4c0-8b35-422f-8130-70cbf1af6ab5/markdown_0/imgs/img_in_image_box_188_1004_551_1246.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T07%3A46%3A20Z%2F-1%2F%2F2d756e3d2891418421c82f9bab5ee369778f5cee8b62f0b3593b4d512f653e41", "imgs/img_in_image_box_1002_610_1137_725.jpg": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//afb9f4c0-8b35-422f-8130-70cbf1af6ab5/markdown_0/imgs/img_in_image_box_1002_610_1137_725.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T07%3A46%3A20Z%2F-1%2F%2F0eeb353b76b4f55aadc262966589a947b9919d7cdd1f531475d7698111892acc"}}, "outputImages": {"layout_det_res": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//afb9f4c0-8b35-422f-8130-70cbf1af6ab5/layout_det_res_0.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T07%3A46%3A20Z%2F-1%2F%2F78db8d9c64050ff5e344a12e1170f4f1293459aee5d28b1e0b6669e1b8af9bdb"}, "inputImage": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//afb9f4c0-8b35-422f-8130-70cbf1af6ab5/input_img_0.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T07%3A46%3A20Z%2F-1%2F%2F333c5cb046312a8f924a1cd798bcb3ec2ded0953e40daf3a33e6cd8145a0db07"}], "dataInfo": {"numPages": 1, "pages": [{"width": 1190, "height": 1684}], "type": "pdf"}, "preprocessedImages": ["https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//afb9f4c0-8b35-422f-8130-70cbf1af6ab5/preprocessed_img_0.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T07%3A46%3A21Z%2F-1%2F%2Fb516d1ce1f181640a809c13dddce68eac51c98a429b1eeb17d2a8add4d52c3ea"]}, "errorCode": 0, "errorMsg": "Success"}
